msgid "Using the Android editor"
msgstr "Usando o editor Android"

msgid ""
"In 2023, we added an `Android port of the editor <https://godotengine.org/"
"article/android_godot_editor_play_store_beta_release/>`__ that can be used "
"to create, develop, and export 2D and 3D projects on Android devices."
msgstr ""
"Em 2023, adicionamos uma `versão para Android do editor <https://"
"godotengine.org/article/android_godot_editor_play_store_beta_release/>`__ "
"que pode ser usada para criar, desenvolver e exportar projetos 2D e 3D em "
"dispositivos Android."

msgid ""
"The app can be downloaded from the `Godot download page <https://"
"godotengine.org/download/android/>`__ or from the `Google Play Store "
"<https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=org.godotengine.editor.v4>`__."
msgstr ""
"O aplicativo pode ser baixado na `página de download do Godot <https://"
"godotengine.org/download/android/>`__ ou na `Google Play Store <https://"
"play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=org.godotengine.editor.v4>`__."

msgid ""
"The Android editor is in early access, while we continue to refine the "
"experience. See :ref:`doc_using_the_android_editor_limitations` below."
msgstr ""
"O editor para Android está em acesso antecipado enquanto continuamos a "
"refinar a experiência. Veja :ref:`doc_using_the_android_editor_limitations` "
"abaixo."

msgid "Android devices support"
msgstr "Suporte de dispositivos Android"

msgid ""
"The Android editor requires devices running Android 5 Lollipop or higher, "
"with at least OpenGL 3 support. This includes (not exhaustive):"
msgstr ""
"O editor Android requer dispositivos executando Android 5 Lollipop ou "
"superior, com suporte mínimo a OpenGL 3. Isso inclui (lista não exaustiva):"

msgid "Android tablets, foldables and large phones"
msgstr "Tablets Android, dobrável e grandes telefones"

msgid "Android-powered netbooks"
msgstr "Netbooks com Android"

msgid "Chromebooks supporting Android apps"
msgstr "Chromebooks com suporte a aplicativos Android"

msgid "Runtime Permissions"
msgstr "Permissões de execução"

msgid ""
"`All files access permission <https://developer.android.com/training/data-"
"storage/manage-all-files#all-files-access>`__: Enables the editor to create, "
"import, and read project files from any file locations on the device. "
"Without this permission, the editor is still functional, but has limited "
"access to the device's files and directories."
msgstr ""
"`Permissão de acesso a todos os arquivos <https://developer.android.com/"
"training/data-storage/manage-all-files#all-files-access>`__: Permite ao "
"editor criar, importar e ler arquivos de projeto em qualquer local do "
"dispositivo. Sem essa permissão, o editor continua funcional, mas com acesso "
"limitado aos arquivos e diretórios do dispositivo."

msgid ""
"`REQUEST_INSTALL_PACKAGES <https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#REQUEST_INSTALL_PACKAGES>`__: Enables the editor to "
"install exported project APKs."
msgstr ""
"`REQUEST_INSTALL_PACKAGES <https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#REQUEST_INSTALL_PACKAGES>`__: Permite que o editor "
"instale APKs de projetos exportados."

msgid ""
"`RECORD_AUDIO <https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#RECORD_AUDIO>`__: Requested when the `audio/driver/"
"enable_input <https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/"
"class_projectsettings.html#class-projectsettings-property-audio-driver-"
"enable-input>`__ project setting is enabled."
msgstr ""
"`RECORD_AUDIO <https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#RECORD_AUDIO>`__: Requisitado quando a configuração de "
"projeto `audio/driver/enable_input <https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/"
"classes/class_projectsettings.html#class-projectsettings-property-audio-"
"driver-enable-input>`__ está habilitada."

msgid "Tips & Tricks"
msgstr "Dicas e truques"

msgid "**Input**"
msgstr "**Input** (Entrada)"

msgid ""
"For the best experience and high level of productivity, connecting a "
"bluetooth keyboard & mouse is recommended to interact with the Android "
"editor. The Android editor supports all of the `usual shortcuts and key "
"mappings <https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/editor/"
"default_key_mapping.html>`__."
msgstr ""
"Para a melhor experiência e alto nível de produtividade, recomenda-se "
"conectar um teclado e mouse bluetooth para interagir com o editor Android. O "
"editor Android oferece suporte a todos os `atalhos e mapeamentos de teclas "
"usuais <https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/editor/"
"default_key_mapping.html>`__."

msgid ""
"When interacting with keyboard & mouse, you can decrease the size of the "
"scrollbar using the `interface/touchscreen/increase_scrollbar_touch_area "
"<https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/"
"class_editorsettings.html#class-editorsettings-property-interface-"
"touchscreen-increase-scrollbar-touch-area>`__ editor setting."
msgstr ""
"Ao interagir com teclado e mouse, você pode reduzir o tamanho da barra de "
"rolagem usando a configuração do editor `interface/touchscreen/"
"increase_scrollbar_touch_area <https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/"
"classes/class_editorsettings.html#class-editorsettings-property-interface-"
"touchscreen-increase-scrollbar-touch-area>`__."

msgid ""
"For 2D projects, the `block coding plugin <https://godotengine.org/asset-"
"library/asset/3095>`__ can provide a block-based visual alternative to "
"composing scripts when lacking a connected hardware keyboard."
msgstr ""
"Para projetos 2D, o `plugin de block coding <https://godotengine.org/asset-"
"library/asset/3095>`__ pode fornecer uma alternativa visual baseada em "
"blocos para compor scripts quando não houver um teclado de hardware "
"conectado."

msgid "**Multi-tasking**"
msgstr "**Multitarefa**"

msgid ""
"On smaller devices, enabling and using picture-in-picture (PiP) mode "
"provides the ability to easily transition between the *Editor* and the *Play "
"window*."
msgstr ""
"Em dispositivos menores, habilitar e usar o modo picture-in-picture (PiP) "
"permite transitar facilmente entre o *Editor* e a *Janela de reprodução*."

msgid ""
"PiP can be enabled via the `run/window_placement/play_window_pip_mode "
"<https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/classes/"
"class_editorsettings.html#class-editorsettings-property-run-window-placement-"
"play-window-pip-mode>`__ editor setting."
msgstr ""
"O PiP pode ser habilitado por meio da configuração do editor `run/"
"window_placement/play_window_pip_mode <https://docs.godotengine.org/en/"
"latest/classes/class_editorsettings.html#class-editorsettings-property-run-"
"window-placement-play-window-pip-mode>`__."

msgid ""
"The `run/window_placement/android_window <https://docs.godotengine.org/en/"
"latest/classes/class_editorsettings.html#class-editorsettings-property-run-"
"window-placement-android-window>`__ editor setting can be used to specify "
"whether the *Play* window should always launch in PiP mode."
msgstr ""
"A configuração do editor `run/window_placement/android_window <https://"
"docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/classes/class_editorsettings.html#class-"
"editorsettings-property-run-window-placement-android-window>`__ pode ser "
"usada para especificar se a janela *Play* deve sempre ser iniciada no modo "
"PiP."

msgid "**Note:** In PiP mode, the *Play* window does not have input access."
msgstr ""
"**Observação:** No modo PiP, a janela *Play* não tem acesso de entrada."

msgid "**Projects sync**"
msgstr "**Sincronização de projetos**"

msgid ""
"Syncing projects via Git can be done by downloading an Android Git client. "
"We recommend the `Termux terminal <https://termux.dev/en/>`__, an Android "
"terminal emulator which provides access to common terminal utilities such "
"Git and SSH."
msgstr ""
"A sincronização de projetos via Git pode ser feita baixando um cliente Git "
"para Android. Recomendamos o `Termux terminal <https://termux.dev/en/>`__, "
"um emulador de terminal para Android que fornece acesso a utilitários comuns "
"de terminal, como Git e SSH."

msgid ""
"**Note:** To use Git with the Termux terminal, you'll need to grant *WRITE* "
"permission to the terminal. This can be done by `running the following "
"command <https://wiki.termux.com/wiki/Termux-setup-storage>`__ from within "
"the terminal: ``termux-setup-storage``"
msgstr ""
"**Nota:** Para usar o Git com o terminal Termux, você precisará conceder "
"permissão de *ESCRITA* ao terminal. Isso pode ser feito `executando o "
"seguinte comando <https://wiki.termux.com/wiki/Termux-setup-storage>`__ "
"dentro do terminal: ``termux-setup-storage``"

msgid "**Plugins**"
msgstr "**Plugins**"

msgid ""
"GDExtension plugins work as expected, but require the plugin developer to "
"provide native Android binaries."
msgstr ""
"Os plugins GDExtension funcionam conforme o esperado, mas exigem que o "
"desenvolvedor do plugin forneça binários nativos do Android."

msgid "Limitations & known issues"
msgstr "Limitações e problemas conhecidos"

msgid "Here are the known limitations and issues of the Android editor:"
msgstr "Aqui estão as limitações e problemas conhecidos do editor Android:"

msgid "No C#/Mono support."
msgstr "Sem suporte a C#/Mono."

msgid "No support for external script editors."
msgstr "Sem suporte para editores de script externos."

msgid ""
"While available, the Forward+ renderer is not recommended due to severe "
"performance issues."
msgstr ""
"Enquanto disponível, o renderizador Forward+ não é recomendado devido a "
"problemas graves de desempenho."

msgid "UX not optimized for Android phones form-factor."
msgstr ""
"Experiência de Usuário(UX) não otimizada para o formato de telefones Android."

msgid ""
"`Android Go devices <https://developer.android.com/guide/topics/"
"androidgo>`__ lacks the *All files access* permission required for device "
"read/write access. As a workaround, when using an Android Go device, it's "
"recommended to create new projects only in the Android *Documents* or "
"*Downloads* directories."
msgstr ""
"`Dispositivos Android Go <https://developer.android.com/guide/topics/"
"androidgo>`__ falta a permissão *Acceso a todos os arquivos* necessários "
"para o acesso de leitura/gravação do dispositivo. Como solução alternativa, "
"ao usar um dispositivo Android Go, recomenda-se criar novos projetos apenas "
"nos diretórios Android *Documents* ou *Downloads*."

msgid ""
"The editor doesn't properly resume when *Don't keep activities* is enabled "
"in the *Developer Options*."
msgstr ""
"O editor não retoma corretamente quando *Não mantenha atividades* está "
"habilitado nas *Opções do desenvolvedor*."

msgid ""
"There is a `bug <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/70751>`__ with "
"the Samsung keyboard that causes random input to be inserted when writing "
"scripts. It's recommended to use the `Google keyboard (Gboard) <https://"
"play.google.com/store/apps/details?"
"id=com.google.android.inputmethod.latin>`__ instead."
msgstr ""
"Há um `bug <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/70751>`__ com o "
"teclado da Samsung que causa a inserção aleatória de entradas ao escrever "
"scripts. Recomenda-se usar o `teclado do Google (Gboard) <https://"
"play.google.com/store/apps/details?"
"id=com.google.android.inputmethod.latin>`__ em vez disso."

msgid ""
"See the `list of open issues on GitHub related to the Android editor "
"<https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues?"
"q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3Aplatform%3Aandroid+label%3Atopic%3Aeditor>`__ "
"for a list of known bugs."
msgstr ""
"Consulte a `lista de problemas abertos no GitHub relacionados ao editor "
"Android <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues?"
"q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3Aplatform%3Aandroid+label%3Atopic%3Aeditor>`__ "
"para ver os bugs conhecidos."
